      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town sits at the crossroads of State Route 38 and Arthur Bradley Road, nine miles north of London, Ohio’s county seat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
